{{Term/Store|Hearty Bass|Hearty Bass|Series, BotW, TotK, AoC, AoI|plural}} are recurring [[Creature]]s and [[Item]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Material"/><ref name="AoI Materials"/>

==Characteristics==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract|Hearty Bass}}
Hearty Bass are a type of [[Fish]] that can be found in the [[Water (Terrain)|Waters]] of [[West Necluda]] and the [[Akkala Highlands]]. Schools of Hearty Bass can be found in ponds located on [[Firly Plateau]] and [[Mount Rhoam]]. Their large bodies are able to store a lot of nutrients.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> Exposing Hyrule Basses to [[Fire]] results in [[Roasted Hearty Bass]]es, while chilling it with [[Ice]] results in [[Frozen Hearty Bass]]es. They can be eaten raw to heal two [[Heart]]s. [[Meal]]s made using Hearty Bass will grant [[Link]] [[Extra Hearts]] when eaten.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/>

